Subject: [PATCH] Accelerate registration of hugepage-backed host memory

---
 kernel-open/common/inc/nv-linux.h             |  10 ++
 kernel-open/common/inc/nv.h                   |   2 +
 kernel-open/nvidia/nv-dma.c                   | 107 +++++++++---
 kernel-open/nvidia/nv-mmap.c                  |  16 +-
 kernel-open/nvidia/nv-usermap.c               |   5 +-
 kernel-open/nvidia/nv.c                       |  53 ++++--
 kernel-open/nvidia/os-mlock.c                 | 153 ++++++++++++++++--
 src/nvidia/arch/nvalloc/unix/include/nv.h     |   2 +
